---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Arrow from '../../components/Arrow.astro'
import Consultation from '../../components/Consultation.astro'
import { capabilities, interests } from '../../data/brand'
---

<Layout>
  <section class="section page-intro brand-intro">
    <div class="container brand-lede">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About me / Zain Saleem</p>
        <h1>
          Curious first.
          <br />
          <span class="serif">Building ever since.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-intro-copy">
        <p class="large-copy">
          I'm Zain, a hands-on AI-assisted SaaS builder, Head of SaaS at
          LemStudio, and someone whose background in SEO still shapes the way I
          solve business problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've never been particularly interested in doing something just
          because it sounds impressive. I want to understand the problem, build
          what helps, and see it work for the people who actually use it.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/my-story/">
          Read my full story <Arrow diagonal />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container brand-prose-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What shaped me</p>
        <h2>
          It started with
          <br />
          <span class="serif">curiosity.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-reading">
        <p>
          In seventh grade, I was learning HTML and CSS from YouTube and
          experimenting with CMD, batch scripts and Windows customizations. I
          wasn't building a career plan; I just liked finding out how things
          worked.
        </p>
        <p>
          At 15, I started working with RedsGlow on WordPress sites, speed,
          hosting and technical troubleshooting. One unexpected website outage
          taught me something I still believe: you don't have to know the answer
          immediately to take responsibility for finding it.
        </p>
        <p>
          SEO became my next chapter. At Pearl Lemon I grew from Off-Page SEO
          Intern to Head of Off-Page SEO for client-facing work. Alongside US
          agency experience with Tracemark Impression, I learned to manage
          campaigns, support teams and understand what growing businesses
          actually need.
        </p>
        <p>
          A weekend software challenge changed the direction of my work. It led
          to a chance to work directly with Pearl Lemon's CEO, Deepak Shukla,
          and helped set LemStudio in motion. Today, I lead its SaaS work:
          shaping solutions, building with AI-assisted tools, testing,
          coordinating launches and looking after what happens after a product
          ships.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section brand-soft-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The work today</p>
          <h2>
            Three areas.
            <br />
            <span class="serif">One practical approach.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-aside">
          Software, automation and SEO make sense together when the starting
          point is a real business need.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-capabilities">
        {capabilities.map((item, i) => (
          <article class="brand-capability">
            <span class="eyebrow">
              {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')} / {item.label}
            </span>
            <h3>{item.heading}</h3>
            <p>{item.description}</p>
            <a class="text-link" href={item.href}>
              Explore this area <Arrow diagonal />
            </a>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container brand-prose-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Beyond work</p>
        <h2>
          There's more
          <br />
          <span class="serif">to the story.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-reading">
        <p>
          I write poetry, read books, enjoy cooking and play cricket with
          friends. I like having interests that aren't about shipping features
          or checking campaign performance.
        </p>
        <ul class="brand-interests">
          {interests.map((item) => (
            <li>{item}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p>
          I'm interested in meeting clients and partners who have meaningful
          challenges to solve. Over time, I want to build something of my own at
          the intersection of SEO and software—but I care more about doing the
          current work well than making grand claims about the future.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/experience/">
          Explore my experience <Arrow diagonal />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Consultation />
</Layout>
